## unblock (MCP)

This workspace is tracked by **unblock**. Issue-data operations are exposed over MCP — the
`unblock` CLI is lifecycle/ops only.

- Start the server: `unblock serve` (MCP over stdio).
- Contract: `unblock.mcp.v1.3`.
- Tools: use the MCP tool set (create/list/close/dep/…) — do NOT shell out to the CLI for
issue data.
